  "$comment": "The type stack (master plan §4; design note §3.2 and §9 task 12; Q20). Every face is a pinned Fontsource package, self-hosted through the static export and loaded by unicode-range. ui: the chrome's three variable faces (exact 450/550 weights). titles: original headlines, in this order in --font-title; scripts are ISO 15924 codes, and packages/ui/scripts/font_coverage.py checks each one over the fixture week. systemFallbacks: CJK titles use the reader's own fonts.",
